{
  "song_id": 2755,
  "title": "My Favorite Ladies",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Mmm... ladies",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "My favorite ladies",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AA",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Mary — you make me wanna eat you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Every time I see you, it's like the first time I meet you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Fragrance like a flower, subtle and sweet too",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Seductive in whatever, it might as well be see-through",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Like my genie in a bottle",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Bitch could get me rich, look like a magaziney model",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Before you know it, he have her on a stroll",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Fresh and ripe, complexion like Acapulco Gold",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "If I had to guess — just right, not a day old",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Like a cradle robber, copped her off Shabba \"Trailor Load\" (\"Trailor load!\")",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Know the right number, you could get her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "And hit it while you would've sold to the highest bidder",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Like – fruits and berries, bring daddy loot in a hurry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Just be cute, and don't worry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Type to make a nigga hallucinate and admit it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Then she started losin' weight and lettin' everybody hit it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "(Ally) Unlike Ally — sometimes she get bitter",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Always kept me happy, never had a problem with her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "She used to let me use her back when I was looser",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Respect her to to this day, and never did abuse her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "I told her I'll be faithful, but she don't believe me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "I probably could've been if I'd never met Evie",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "She make me feel all fuzzy inside, it's loco",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "You won't get nowheres near her if you're broke though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Kept a shorty, mad fine and much thinner",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "If caught, I get mad time just for touchin' her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Knock wood, so much for hymens",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "So fly, she should be in the sky with diamonds",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "(Lucy) — Little young thing, she likes to do the tongue thing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "At times, she would play hard to get, fronting or something",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "She made me feel like the number one king",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Run into her now, and we'll still catch a fun fling",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Met her out in Central Park, that's one side",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Had the God mentally sparked, reflectin' sunshine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "She said, \"You need to stop messin' with that white girl –",
          "rhyme": "9Rl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "She fuckin' with your head, and got your heart in a tight curl\"",
          "rhyme": "9Rl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "(Cookie) — We messed around once or twice, but she don't know me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "She helped me get money at the dunce price OT",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Plus she from Colombia, so she really Spanish",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Cookie known to make a cat bank account vanish",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "(Miss Hazy) And Miss Hazy — older woman, mature, Black",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Every time she sees me, I end up gettin' towed back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "All she want me to do is blaze it crazy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "The only one complaint is that she make me too lazy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Sugar-mommy laced me with the butter navy Avi'",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "Just her way to make up for the headaches that she gave me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "It's all gravy, when I'm done gettin' my mack on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Ally is always there to help me get back on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDEFGGHIIJJKKLIMINJBCIIOPQQQQRSTTNBUUVVJJJNPP",
